===Etymology===
From ''JakeBrake'', a brand name for engine braking systems, from the surname {{m|en|Jacobs}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=jake [[brake]]}}

# {{lb|en|slang}} Especially on [[trucks]], an [[engine]] [[compression]] [[brake]] that closes the valves in an engine in order to slow the vehicle; an [[engine]] [[retarder]].

